@startuml US001-SSD
autonumber
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

actor "User" as Actor
participant ":System" as System

activate Actor
Actor -> System : initiates personal data logging (age, weight, height, gender, activity level)
activate System

System --> Actor : requests personal data form / input fields
Actor -> System : submits personal data details

System -> System : validates inputs and computes nutritional baseline/goals
System --> Actor : confirms successful profile update and displays calculated goals


deactivate System
deactivate Actor

@enduml